{"unit_id":"OPaimon__dsh-model-gate#card-zh","repo":"OPaimon/dsh-model-gate","commit":"99ff88fc9fe432faf8ba3dfc0b3f3d2e13809896","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-gate 是 DSH Web 的模型禁用插件。它过滤 provider 和模型目录，并在 llm/stream 请求仍到达禁用模型时返回 MODEL_DISABLED 错误；Web 设置页提供按 provider 分组的模型开关。用户可禁用整个 provider、精确的 provider/model 或跨 provider 的 */model 规则，并在面板查看目录、热更新名单。适合想整理模型列表或阻止特定模型被调用的用户。名单保存在 DSH 设置中，无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:154-194","src/client/main.tsx:111-123","src/contract.ts:54-59"]}
